  "template": "Metric Generic Model.rft",
  "about": "Mobile hoist modelled as a generic product: two legs with spread actuator and cross member, four castors with forks and brake pedals, mast, boom, actuator ram, hanger and spreader bar with hooks, push handle, control box, battery, emergency stop, hand control. The sling sweep envelope is a Clearance Operation solid around the spreader bar. Reference: query: patient hoist mobile specialty equipment hospital; images: https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=patient+hoist+mobile+specialty+equipment+hospital; basis: generic product; brand, model and supplier open for review",
